stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Draft
  Draft --> Validated: schema + source + golden cases
  Validated --> ComplianceReviewed: independent legal/tax review
  ComplianceReviewed --> SecurityReviewed: integrity and control review
  SecurityReviewed --> Approved: regulatory approver signature
  Approved --> Scheduled: release operator selects effective window
  Scheduled --> Active: signature and readiness rechecked
  Active --> Retired: new approved version effective
  Validated --> Rejected
  ComplianceReviewed --> Rejected
  SecurityReviewed --> Rejected
  Approved --> Revoked: evidence invalidated before activation
  Active --> Suspended: security/integrity incident
  Suspended --> Active: approved recovery only
  Retired --> [*]

  note right of Active
    Existing transactions remain pinned.
    Rollback affects new selection only.
  end note
